<!-- File Share with friends (port/linux/src/p2p_fileshare.h; docs/fileshare-friends.md;
menu_functions.c "port fileshare share ...", "port fileshare send ...", "port fileshare friend ..."),
in Halo 3's look: Start on a file of FILE SHARE (fileshare.xml) opens its SHARING question - SHARE
WITH FRIENDS or STOP SHARING (friends see the files shared in this machine's File Share) and SEND TO
A FRIEND (the friends online: Cross sends it, the friend is asked first); the FRIENDS screen's
options on a friend online (friends.xml, Triangle) have FILE SHARE, the friend's shared files:
Cross asks DOWNLOAD? first, then the file comes, is checked by the validator and saved; Triangle
asks again. Menu style Classic+ shows classic/fileshare_friends.xml's cp/ screens in their place
(the same rows' names). The art is this folder's own. -->
